      "title": "Start here — FL2V",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Agent-Infra — editable local workflow\nUpload your image(s), edit the prompt and duration, then click Run.\nResolutionSelector: choose aspect ratio and megapixels: 480P=0.3828125, 544P=0.5, 720P=0.861328125, 768P=0.98. Canvas rounds to multiples of 32.\nOutput: 24 fps video with native audio. Duration rounds up to the H3 frame grid.\nFor manual sessions, first stop this GPU's pull-worker service (see workflows/comfyui/README.md); wait for its current cloud task to finish. Restart the worker after manual jobs finish.\nThis runs directly on this ComfyUI GPU; outputs appear in SaveVideo and local output/video/manual. Cloud API task history and GCS upload apply to API submissions only.\n\nFL2V: Upload both first and last frames."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {},
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
